    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d447">

                <pb facs="0469" n="1203" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1203"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Dupuy de Lôme to
                        Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Spanish Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Philadelphia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-10-07"><hi rendition="#italic">October 7,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The lawyer who is in Wilmington, N. C., urging the release of the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Commodore</hi> is the same Mr. Reuben Pastner, of B.
                    Guerra, treasurer of the Cuban Junta and one of the counsel for the defendants
                    in the trial at Wilmington, Del.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dupuy de Lôme.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d447-a1.xml" xpointer="d447-a1"/>
